{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39861","headline":"白鸽 · 徐夤","name":"白鸽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举翼凌空碧，依人到大邦。\n粉翎栖画阁，雪影拂琼窗。\n振鹭堪爲侣，鸣鸠好作双。\n狎鸥归未得，覩尔忆晴江。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「白鸽」条，撰者秦岭梅、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"秦岭梅"}